# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To encode 6 numbers, we will need to have at least 6 available states on whose amplitudes we can encode. This will require 3 qubits. Using an unknown normalization factor $\\alpha$, we can write this as:\n"
msgstr "Para codificar 6 números, precisaremos ter pelo menos 6 estados disponíveis em cujas amplitudes possamos codificar. Isso vai requerer 3 qubits. Usando um fator de normalização desconhecido $\\alpha$, podemos escrever isso como:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\alpha}(9|000\\rangle+8|001\\rangle+6|010\\rangle+2|011\\rangle+9|100\\rangle+2|101\\rangle+0|110\\rangle+0|111\\rangle)\n"
"$$\n"
"Note that\n"
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi|\\psi\\rangle = \\frac{1}{|\\alpha|^2}\\times(9^2+8^2+6^2+2^2+9^2+2^2+0^2+0^2) = \\frac{1}{|\\alpha|^2}\\times(270)=1 \\rightarrow \\alpha = \\sqrt{270}\n"
"$$\n"
"So finally,\n"
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{270}}(9|000\\rangle+8|001\\rangle+6|010\\rangle+2|011\\rangle+9|100\\rangle+2|101\\rangle+0|110\\rangle+0|111\\rangle)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\alpha}(9|000\\rangle+8|001\\rangle+6|010\\rangle+2|011\\rangle+9|100\\rangle+2|101\\rangle+0|110\\rangle+0|111\\rangle)\n"
"$$\n"
"Observe que\n"
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi|\\psi\\rangle = \\frac{1}{|\\alpha|^2}\\times(9^2+8^2+6^2+2^2+9^2+2^2+0^2+0^2) = \\frac{1}{|\\alpha|^2}\\times(270)=1 \\rightarrow \\alpha = \\sqrt{270}\n"
"$$\n"
"Portanto, finalmente,\n"
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{270}}(9|000\\rangle+8|001\\rangle+6|010\\rangle+2|011\\rangle+9|100\\rangle+2|101\\rangle+0|110\\rangle+0|111\\rangle)\n"
"$$\n"

